  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As we know for an Adiabatic process</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>Constant</mtext></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/bbe9d799-1e12-4ca5-b1d8-b2ed2f71dd83.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 294px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>For Isothermal process</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Dividing equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;by&nbsp;equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
